    """Strip a leading arabic article written solid: ElSayide -> sayide.

    Only 'al/el/ul/il' or a sun-letter article whose consonant is doubled by
    assimilation (ash-Shamsi -> ashshamsi, an-Najjar -> annajjar) qualifies,
